# This file ensures the auth-bg directory is tracked by git
#
# 🚀 FULLY AUTOMATIC - Just drop images here!
#
# The system automatically detects ALL image files in this directory.
# No code changes needed - just add/remove image files.
#
# Supported formats: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .webp, .svg
#
# Examples:
# - tech-network.jpg
# - nature-mountain.png
# - city-hkjc.jpg
# - city-shenzhen.webp
# - custom-background.gif
#
# Images rotate alphabetically. Use prefixes to control order:
# - 01-city-hkjc.jpg (first)
# - 02-tech-network.jpg (second)
# - 03-nature.jpg (third)
